Provide a restartable stop operation that joins the statistics finalizer
before the store is closed. Serialize stop, resume and disposal so a second
closer cannot return while the first is still using SQLite. Route acceptance
to the reply server when the receive queue is already secured, and keep the
local LET command independent of receive-server ACK retries.

Recheck pending deliveries after retry delays and join replaced queue
workers so they cannot outlive their store or send deleted messages.

